WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:02.069 --> 00:00:04.605
.

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:05.839 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Sur la route vers Camp-Perrin,

00:00:03.704 --> 00:00:08.475 size:53% position:73% line:68%
une partie de la montagne

00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:09.676 size:53% position:73% line:68%
s'est littéralement déversée

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:10.911 size:53% position:73% line:68%
sur le chemin principal.

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:11.912 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Des maisons effondrées

00:00:09.977 --> 00:00:12.946 size:53% position:73% line:68%
longent la route, témoignant

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:17.418 size:53% position:73% line:68%
de la violence du tremblement

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:18.452 size:53% position:73% line:68%
de terre il y a quatre jours

00:00:13.247 --> 00:00:19.453 size:53% position:73% line:68%
à peine.

00:00:17.718 --> 00:00:20.487 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Cette grand-mère nous raconte

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:21.488 size:53% position:73% line:68%
que ces trois petits-enfants se

00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:22.523 size:53% position:73% line:68%
trouvaient dans cette pièce lors

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:25.993 size:53% position:73% line:68%
du séisme. Ils se font soigner

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:34.601 size:53% position:73% line:68%
à Port-au-Prince et aux Cayes.

00:00:22.823 --> 00:00:35.602 size:53% position:73% line:68%
C'est elle qui les élève.

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:36.637 size:53% position:73% line:68%
(en créole)

00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:38.639 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 "Mon petit-fils a le bras

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:44.244 size:53% position:73% line:68%
éventré, a besoin d'une greffe,

00:00:36.937 --> 00:00:45.245 size:53% position:73% line:68%
dit-elle. Aidez-nous."

00:00:38.939 --> 00:00:46.246 size:53% position:73% line:68%
(en créole)

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:47.281 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Donc, c'est ici?

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:48.315 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Gerda Lovermon était dans

00:00:46.547 --> 00:00:50.451 size:53% position:73% line:68%
sa maison avec ses sept enfants

00:00:47.581 --> 00:00:57.057 size:53% position:73% line:68%
lors de l'événement,

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:58.792 size:53% position:73% line:68%
comme elle dit.

00:00:50.751 --> 00:00:59.793 size:53% position:73% line:68%
(en créole)

00:00:57.357 --> 00:01:00.828 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Pas de victimes?

00:00:59.093 --> 00:01:02.329 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Le toit en tôle semble

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:03.363 size:53% position:73% line:68%
avoir sauvé sa famille,

00:01:01.128 --> 00:01:04.364 size:53% position:73% line:68%
car ces maisons semblent

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:05.399 size:53% position:73% line:68%
avoir mieux résisté

00:01:03.664 --> 00:01:06.433 size:53% position:73% line:68%
que celles en béton.

00:01:04.665 --> 00:01:07.468 size:53% position:73% line:68%
JEAN MAXIME EUGÈNE, économe

00:01:05.699 --> 00:01:08.469 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Séminaire Collège Mazenod

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:09.503 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Comme on dit, c'est pas

00:01:07.768 --> 00:01:15.242 size:53% position:73% line:68%
les tremblements de terre

00:01:08.769 --> 00:01:16.443 size:53% position:73% line:68%
qui tuent; c'est le béton

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:17.444 size:53% position:73% line:68%
qui tue, parce que...

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:18.479 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Il y a des petites maisons,

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.513 size:53% position:73% line:68%
là, je vois qu'il y a

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:23.217 size:53% position:73% line:68%
des petites maisons

00:01:18.779 --> 00:01:31.692 size:53% position:73% line:68%
sur les routes qui ont...

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:32.693 size:53% position:73% line:68%
résisté au tremblement de terre.

00:01:23.517 --> 00:01:33.727 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Mais les grandes maisons...

00:01:31.992 --> 00:01:34.761 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Ici, à Mazenod, le lieu

00:01:32.993 --> 00:01:35.762 size:53% position:73% line:68%
spirituel où les prêtres

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:38.532 size:53% position:73% line:68%
haïtiens font leur retraite,

00:01:35.062 --> 00:01:39.533 size:53% position:73% line:68%
deux personnes sont mortes

00:01:36.063 --> 00:01:41.001 size:53% position:73% line:68%
sous les décombres.

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:42.035 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Toutes nos structures

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:46.974 size:53% position:73% line:68%
sont démolies. Le collège,

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:47.975 size:53% position:73% line:68%
le petit similaire, notre

00:01:42.336 --> 00:01:48.976 size:53% position:73% line:68%
noviciat, nos maisons.

00:01:47.274 --> 00:01:52.012 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Toutes nos structures,

00:01:48.275 --> 00:01:53.013 size:53% position:73% line:68%
sauf ces deux maisons-là,

00:01:49.276 --> 00:01:54.047 size:53% position:73% line:68%
qui sont restés...

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:55.048 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Comment se fait-il?

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:56.083 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Est-ce qu'elles ont été

00:01:54.348 --> 00:01:57.117 size:53% position:73% line:68%
construites plus tard?

00:01:55.349 --> 00:01:58.151 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Oui, elles ont été

00:01:56.383 --> 00:01:59.153 size:53% position:73% line:68%
construites plus tard.

00:01:57.417 --> 00:02:00.721 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Mais un prêtre

00:01:58.452 --> 00:02:01.755 size:53% position:73% line:68%
a pu être sauvé.

00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:05.859 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Bon, après le temps...

00:02:01.021 --> 00:02:07.528 size:53% position:73% line:68%
la maison s'est écoulée.

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:08.529 size:53% position:73% line:68%
On avait un prêtre ici, là.

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:09.563 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Ah! oui?

00:02:07.828 --> 00:02:10.597 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Dans le trou, là?

00:02:08.829 --> 00:02:11.632 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Dans le trou.

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:15.235 size:53% position:73% line:68%
On a creusé le trou...

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:16.236 size:53% position:73% line:68%
pour le retirer.

00:02:11.932 --> 00:02:18.138 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Le trou n'était pas là.

00:02:15.536 --> 00:02:19.139 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Et il est sorti vivant?

00:02:16.537 --> 00:02:20.173 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- Il est sorti vivant.

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:21.208 size:53% position:73% line:68%
- "Personne du gouvernement

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:22.209 size:53% position:73% line:68%
ou des autorités haïtiennes

00:02:20.474 --> 00:02:25.012 size:53% position:73% line:68%
ne sont venues; nous sommes

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:31.418 size:53% position:73% line:68%
abandonnés à notre sort",

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:32.419 size:53% position:73% line:68%
nous dit-on.

00:02:25.312 --> 00:02:33.453 size:53% position:73% line:68%
(chant)

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:34.488 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Malgré la dévastation,

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:38.058 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Gerda et ses enfants

00:02:33.754 --> 00:02:39.059 size:53% position:73% line:68%
remercient le bon Dieu

00:02:34.788 --> 00:02:40.093 size:53% position:73% line:68%
d'être encore en vie.

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:41.762 size:53% position:73% line:68%
(chant)

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:42.763 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Elle attend son huitième enfant

00:02:40.394 --> 00:02:43.797 size:53% position:73% line:68%
avec impatience, car malgré

00:02:42.062 --> 00:02:44.831 size:53% position:73% line:68%
tout, la vie doit continuer.

00:02:43.063 --> 00:02:45.299 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Ici Azeb Wolde-Giorghis,

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:45.299 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Radio-Canada,

00:02:45.132 --> 00:02:45.299 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Camp-Perrin, Ha

